BT 1 0 0 1 0 29 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL 1.516753 Tw (The Ambulance Dispatch Simulator is a console-based Java program that dispatches the nearest available) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.128483 Tw (ambulance to an emergency. Each emergency has a severity from 1 \(critical\) to 3 \(minor\). When all ambulances) Tj T* 0 Tw (are busy, requests wait in a queue and the most severe request is served first.) Tj T* ET
