BT 1 0 0 1 0 41.8 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL 1.578987 Tw (The city map is stored as a weighted graph whose edges are distances in kilometres. Dijkstra's algorithm,) Tj T* 0 Tw .207152 Tw (implemented with a PriorityQueue, is run from every free ambulance to find the shortest path to the emergency) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.079814 Tw (location, and the ambulance with the smallest distance is dispatched. A second PriorityQueue keeps the waiting) Tj T* 0 Tw (requests ordered by severity, with first-come-first-served order for equal severity.) Tj T* ET
