BT 1 0 0 1 0 41.8 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL 1.668928 Tw (The program keeps the status \(Available/Busy\) and the current location of every ambulance, and provides) Tj T* 0 Tw 2.641861 Tw (dispatch, complete-trip and show-status features as methods. It is a beginner-level Data Structures and) Tj T* 0 Tw .16061 Tw (Algorithms \(DSA\) project \(PS No. 83\) written in a single Java file. The program was compiled and run with JDK) Tj T* 0 Tw (21 and produces the expected result for all four given test cases.) Tj T* ET
