BT 1 0 0 1 0 29 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL .153712 Tw (In an emergency, two decisions matter most: which ambulance can reach the patient fastest, and which patient) Tj T* 0 Tw -0.037801 Tw (must be helped first when help is limited. Graph algorithms answer the first question and priority queues answer) Tj T* 0 Tw (the second, which makes this scenario a good way to learn how data structures solve real problems.) Tj T* ET
