BT 1 0 0 1 0 41.8 Tm /F1 9.4 Tf 12.8 TL .020699 Tw (The user enters an emergency location and a severity. The program checks that the location exists on the map,) Tj T* 0 Tw .154388 Tw (finds the free ambulance with the shortest route using Dijkstra's algorithm, marks it busy and prints its path and) Tj T* 0 Tw 1.005047 Tw (distance. If no ambulance is free, the request is queued. When an ambulance completes its trip, it becomes) Tj T* 0 Tw (available at the emergency location and immediately serves the most severe waiting request, if any.) Tj T* ET
